{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-05-17 07:30:00', 'title': "EAT WELL GROUP'S INVESTEE COMPANY ANNOUNCES DISTRIBUTION OF AMARA ORGANIC FOODS TO KROGER'S ECOMMERCE PLATFORMS", 'text': "VANCOUVER, BRITISH COLUMBIA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EAT WELL INVESTMENT GROUP INC. (THE “COMPANY” OR “EAT WELL GROUP” OR “EWG”) (CN:EWG) (US:EWGFF) (FRA:6BC0) IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT ONE OF ITS INVESTEE COMPANIES, AMARA ORGANIC FOODS (“AMARA”), ONE OF THE FASTEST-GROWING BABY FOOD BRANDS IN AMERICA, IS AVAILABLE AT THE KROGER CO.'S (NYSE:KR) (“KROGER”) ECOMMERCE PLATFORMS, KROGER.COM AND VITACOST.COM. HEADQUARTERED IN CINCINNATI, OHIO, KROGER IS ONE OF THE LARGEST RETAILERS IN THE UNITED STATES B"}